---
// Página de acceso denegado
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Sin permiso — Asistencia Docente</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background: #fafaf8;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      .card {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 420px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .icono {
        font-size: 3rem;
        background: #fee2e2;
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      h1 {
        font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      p {
        color: #6b7280;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      a {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        display: inline-block;
        background: #1a4d2e;
        color: white;
        padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icono"></div>
      <h1>Acceso denegado</h1>
      <p>No tienes permisos para acceder a esta sección. Si crees que es un error, contacta a la directora.</p>
      <a href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
